1
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:08,200
Folio brings related records into a single review workspace, with each finding connected to its source.

2
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:16,900
This case uses three fictional PDFs. Folio extracts supported fields, records document hashes, and compares matching values.

3
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:28,400
The application lists annual income of 1.2 million rupees. The income proof lists 2.1 million. Folio flags the difference for review.

4
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:34,600
That signal links to evidence lines beside the original PDF, so a reviewer can check the source in context.

5
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:46,500
A reviewer can export a dossier with the findings, evidence references, hashes, and system limitations.

6
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:55,800
These explainable signals are prompts for review, not a fraud verdict. A person must verify important information with authoritative sources.
